  "notes": "{声援|せいえん} is commonly used in sports and performance contexts.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {声援|せいえん}を{送|おく}る: to cheer (for someone), to send encouragement\n- {声援|せいえん}に{応|こた}える: to respond to the cheering\n- {熱|あつ}い{声援|せいえん}: passionate cheering\n\nFORMS:\n{声|こえ} (voice) + {援|えん} (support)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {応援|おうえん}: support, cheering (broader meaning, includes non-vocal support)\n- {歓声|かんせい}: cheers, shouts of joy",
